  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This serves 6 and takes about 2 hours from start to table. The critical thing to watch is the order of the dish: the fish and vegetables cook first in the sauce, then are removed, then the rice cooks in the same sauce and broth. This means the rice absorbs all the flavour of the fish and vegetables that cooked before it."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Stuff the fish with the herb paste before cooking. The filling perfumes the fish and the sauce as it cooks and makes every bite more fragrant."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
